  "note": "compsognathus, v1 Meshy mesh again (COMPYREVERT 2026-10-31, owner: the green remodel looked worse). strafe/strafe_v1/charge are the COMPYFEEL plans with every length (stride, lift, spread, offset, crouch, bob, sway) x1.62, the v1/v2 hind-leg length ratio (0.350/0.216 m upper+lower leg), so the steps look the same on the bigger rig; cycles and angles unchanged. *_green_v2 are the plans as built for work/compsognathus_green_v2.glb. make_gait.py ... compsognathus.json strafe --as strafe_left --travel 1,0,0 (strafe_right: -1,0,0); strafe_v1 --as walk_back --travel 0,1,0; charge. On v1's long feet a 30/20 deg swing curl dragged the toes (2 / 1 cm peak at game scale), so strafe curls 10 deg with lift_shape 0.4 (toe peak 9 cm, toe clears the ground at once at lift-off: planted slip 1.6 cm per step instead of 3.2) and strafe_v1 (walk_back) curls 5 deg with lift 0.065 (6 cm)."
